Was he planning an escape? No one could tell. Two hours passed, and then half an hour more. He heard a noise outside—quick steps, and then

47
00:03:31.271 --> 00:03:36.474
a hasty opening of doors. Passepartout's voice was audible and immediately after, so was the

48
00:03:36.475 --> 00:03:41.235
voice of Fix. The cell door swung open, and Passepartout,

49
00:03:41.236 --> 00:03:44.223
Aouda, and Fix hurried toward Fogg. Fix

50
00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:50.358
